'''Yuki '''(ユキ) is a [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] enemy that appears in the [[Shoumetsu Toshi Collaboration Event]]. She was added in [[Version 3.6 Update|Version 3.6]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Yuki
|image = E 159.png
|appearance = [[Shoumetsu Toshi Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 2,222¢ - 8,776¢
}}

==Enemy==
A rather easy enemy to deal with, high health and range but low attack power, along with a slow attack rate. Since Yuki is a [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] enemy, any [[:Category:Anti-Floating Cats|anti-Floating]] cats can deal with her with ease. In later stages, she is supported by meatshields, so [[:Category:Long Distance Cats|Long Distance]] and [[Wave Attack]] units are able to chip her down.

